ili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":88,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":11011,\"date\":\"2025-11-10T15:56:47+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-11-10T14:56:47+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-air-2026-due-fotocamere\",\"title\":\"L'iPhone Air 2026 potrebbe presentare due fotocamere posteriori, secondo un leaker\",\"excerpt\":\"Il prossimo iPhone Air di Apple potrebbe avere due fotocamere posteriori, secondo un leaker cinese con fonti nella catena di approvvigionamento di Apple.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/11/iphone-air-camera-768x449.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone air camera\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":78,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":10938,\"date\":\"2025-11-05T18:26:17+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-11-05T17:26:17+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-nuovo-colore\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: Si Rumoreggia l'Arrivo di un Solo Nuovo Colore\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta testando tre nuove opzioni di colore per i modelli iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro Max, ma prevede di procedere con solo uno di questi finish.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/11/Coffee-Burgundy-and-Purple-iPhone-18-Pro-Mock-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Coffee Burgundy and Purple iPhone Pro Mock\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":104,\"review\":null,\"changelog\"